        "created_at": "2012-06-20T23:21:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;evandan55&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"evandan55\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So, just wondering, but if my girlfriend and I bring our copy of Arkham Horror, would anyone be interested in joining us for a game? We’ve gotten quite addicted to it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes … except there’s no way I’d have time. First off, I’d like to concentrate on playing Sentinels w/ other Sentinels fans, but even if I did tire of that, doesn’t Arkham take like six hours to play?</p>",
