        "created_at": "2012-06-21T12:23:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, just out of curiosity, do we have a rough head count? From what I’m seeing, it’s myself, arenson9, TheJayMann, Rabit, evandan55, and his gf. I may be bringing a friend, but he has yet to give me anything solid. That’s six, with a possibility of seven. Seems like if we could get one or two more people, that might be ideal. I’ll have my copy of SotM and RC with me, as it lives in my truck. Altogether, it’s shaping up to be a fun night.</p>",
