        "cooked": "<p>Jeez guys, just keeping rubbing it in that the lone folk from Kansas can’t join in. Well fine I guess I better back my bags and head up there, who wants to supply me some lodging for the endeaver? I’m kidding, though I wish I could go but with the amount I would be spending in gas I could instead pay someone else to play with me if I was really that desperate.</p>",
