        "created_at": "2012-06-26T04:32:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Alright, well, I really didn’t want it to come to this, but I’m not gonna be able to make it tomorrow. Honestly I just don’t have the gas money to make it. I’m kinda trying to save up for Gen Con, and this would put a hole in my pocket since it’s a 40 minute drive to this place. I’m really sorry. I do wanna be there. But I’ll just have to wait to Gen Con. Dakota and I will certainly be there! Again, really sorry. Don’t worry, we’ll have four days to play with everyone at Gen Con.</p>",
